{"type":"message","id":"50f33dad","parentId":"bbfea4d8","timestamp":"2026-06-04T09:59:00.257Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-06-04 09:58 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Publish the article located at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-092555/article/final.md to WordPress.\nUse the featured image located at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-092555/media/feature.jpg.\nThe story's category is \"market_movement\".\nExtract the returned WordPress edit URL and write ONLY that URL string into /tmp/wp-result.txt."}],"timestamp":1780567140220}}
